  questions:
  - question: A notebook costs 24 pesos. How much do three notebooks cost?
    answers:
    - 48 pesos
    - 72 pesos
    - 96 pesos
  - question: "Read: ‘Even though it rained, Ana brought the seedlings outside after the clouds cleared.’\n\nWhen did Ana bring the seedlings outside?"
    answers:
    - Before the rain
    - While it was raining
    - After the clouds cleared
  - question: A bus travels 12 kilometers in 30 minutes. At the same speed, how far will it travel in one hour?
    answers:
    - 18 kilometers
    - 24 kilometers
    - 36 kilometers
  - question: Which sentence is an observation rather than a prediction?
    answers:
    - The clock shows 8:15.
    - Everyone will finish before me.
    - This will be my worst examination.
  - question: A class plants 40 seeds. Three-quarters of them sprout. How many seeds sprout?
    answers:
    - 10 seeds
    - 20 seeds
    - 30 seeds
